  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Kotra Subbaiah vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 21 September, 2020 Author: M.Satyanarayana Murthy Bench: M.Satyanarayana Murthy The Hon'Ble Sri Justice M.Satyanarayana Murthy Criminal Petition No.3901 Of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "This criminal petition is filed by the petitioner/accused under Section 482 of Criminal Procedure Code (for short \"Cr.P.C.\") to quash the proceedings in Crime No.415 of 2020 pending on the file of Nandyal Taluk Urban Police Station, Kurnool District, registered for the offences punishable under Sections 188, 328, r/w 34 of Indian Penal Code (for short \"I.P.C.\") and Section 59(1) of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 and Section 4 of Gutka and Pan Masala Prohibition Act, 2015.",
    "arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioners and the learned Public Prosecutor for the State of Andhra Pradesh submit that the issue involved in this petition is squarely covered by the order of this Court in Criminal Petition No.3731 of 2018 and batch dated 27.08.2018.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "Learned counsel for the petitioners and the learned Public Prosecutor for the State of Andhra Pradesh submit that the issue involved in this petition is squarely covered by the order of this Court in Criminal Petition No.3731 of 2018 and batch dated 27.08.2018.",
